inherits Widget

signal Vector2f(mousePos) MousePress   MousePressed
signal Vector2f(mousePos) MouseRelease MouseReleased
signal Vector2f(mousePos) Click        Clicked
signal Vector2f(mousePos) RightMousePress   RightMousePressed
signal Vector2f(mousePos) RightMouseRelease RightMouseReleased
signal Vector2f(mousePos) RightClick        RightClicked
